hout Words</strong><br>No spoken or written dialogue. Meaning is implicitly told though visuals and game play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dog(s)!</strong><br>Choose between multiple dogs to be your guide, source of comfort and motivation, in an otherwise bleak world.<br>Is your dog missing from the game? Contact us and we will try to remedy that!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816180/extras/cbc4c35eaa10b9be3f5a454d46aa1f4e.avif?t=1774033616\" width=1200 height=192 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally conceived during while a student, Fail Fail Succeed grew from feelings of being stuck in a cycle of manic highs and hard crashes. The mechanics were designed as metaphors for those struggles: failure as an inevitable outcome, but traces of progress being left behind. In a bleak world of exhausting repetition, small comforts in the companionship of a loyal pup often became a guiding light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail Fail Succeed is developed by a single developer. What began as a small weekend project, slowly grew after positive feedback, was further developed for GGC and SGA, and is now finally coming to Steam for everyone to play!</p>","developers":["Martin Zetterman"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816180/45d7d7c0a91811a7afdcb7f3037817084bf55317/header.jpg?t=1774033616","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816180/1022979682/e76f5d174fb1a78d04a1189be712e18cd0d7a5b1/1772036478/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772037128","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816180/1022979682/e76f5d174fb1a78d04a1189be712e18cd0d7a5b1/1772036478/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772037128","hi